flowchart TD
    Discover[Technician Discovers Malfunction] --> ScanBench[Scan Physical QR Code at Bench]
    ScanBench --> Passport[Display Digital Asset Passport]
    Passport --> ClickFault[Click 'Report Fault']
    
    ClickFault --> Form[Enter Fault Severity: Low/Med/High/Critical<br/>Failure Category & Symptom Description]
    Form --> Submit[Submit Ticket]
    
    Submit --> LockCheck{Severity Critical?}
    LockCheck -- Yes --> SetDefective[Asset Condition: DEFECTIVE]
    LockCheck -- No --> SetMaint[Asset Condition: UNDER_MAINTENANCE]
    
    SetDefective & SetMaint --> CreateTicket[(Create Work Order: WO-YYYY-XXXX<br/>Status: OPEN)]
    CreateTicket --> AlertTechUnit[ULMD Technology Unit Queue Alerted]
    
    AlertTechUnit --> AssignTech[Technology Unit Assigns Technician<br/>Status: ASSIGNED]
    AssignTech --> AcceptTicket[Technician Accepts Ticket<br/>Status: IN_PROGRESS]
    
    AcceptTicket --> BenchWork[Technician Executes Bench Diagnostics & Repair]
    BenchWork --> LogWork[Submit Maintenance Log:<br/>Actions Taken, Parts Used, Labor Hours,<br/>Outcome Condition: OPERATIONAL]
    LogWork --> TicketResolved[Work Order Status: RESOLVED]
    
    TicketResolved --> CustodianVerify{Custodian Lab Manager<br/>Verifies Operation?}
    CustodianVerify -- Test Fails --> Reopen[Return Ticket to IN_PROGRESS<br/>with Feedback Notes]
    Reopen --> BenchWork
    
    CustodianVerify -- Test Passes --> CloseTicket[Work Order Status: CLOSED<br/>Asset Condition: OPERATIONAL]
    CloseTicket --> Audit[(Append Immutable Audit Record)]
    Audit --> Done([Instrument Returned to Active Service])
